  "title": "Where the main entry points sit",
  "description": "Your application passes bars into kestrel-chartkit. The registry builds indicators from their definitions; indicators stream values, extras and alerts; classify_regime and the scoring functions turn readings into a regime and a composite signal; structure and analytics read the bars directly. Everything comes back as plain data, which a renderer such as chartlet or kestrel-loom draws.",
